## 1. Introduction and Goals

### 1.1 Purpose

{{PURPOSE}}

This repository uses a **capability-based architecture** where functionality is packaged into discrete, composable capabilities that are assembled into profiles.

### 1.2 Quality Goals

| Priority | Goal | Description |
|----------|------|-------------|
| 1 | Composability | Capabilities can be mixed and matched |
| 2 | Discoverability | Easy to find and understand available features |
| 3 | Maintainability | Changes to one capability don't affect others |

## 2. Constraints

### 2.1 Technical Constraints

| Constraint | Description |
|------------|-------------|
| Build System | Capabilities merged via `npm run build` |
