## 3. System Context

### 3.1 Capability Architecture

```
                    ┌─────────────────────────┐
                    │       PROFILES          │
                    │  (User-facing bundles)  │
                    └───────────┬─────────────┘
                                │ compose
        ┌───────────────────────┼───────────────────────┐
        │                       │                       │
        ▼                       ▼                       ▼
┌───────────────┐       ┌───────────────┐       ┌───────────────┐
│  Capability A │       │  Capability B │       │  Capability C │
│  (feature)    │       │  (feature)    │       │  (feature)    │
└───────────────┘       └───────────────┘       └───────────────┘
```

## 4. Solution Strategy

The system uses a three-layer architecture:

1. **Capabilities** - Self-contained feature packages
2. **Profiles** - Compositions of capabilities for specific use cases
3. **Build System** - Merges capabilities into deployable profiles

