## 6. Runtime View

### 6.1 Build Process

```
1. Read profile.yaml
       │
       ▼
2. Resolve capability dependencies
       │
       ▼
3. Merge capability contributions
   ├── Claude commands/skills
   ├── Devcontainer config
   └── Lifecycle scripts
       │
       ▼
4. Write to bld/<profile>/
```

### 6.2 Profile Installation

```
1. User runs: dev profile install <profile>
       │
       ▼
2. Archive existing .devcontainer/ and .claude/
       │
       ▼
3. Copy built profile to workspace
       │
       ▼
4. User runs: dev rebuild (if container changes)
```

